---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EmailLink from '../components/EmailLink.astro';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy — ${site.title}`}
  description="Privacy information for rowlandekemezie.com, including analytics, newsletter subscriptions, comments, and public machine-readable resources."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-stack">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This is a personal website and technical publication. It collects only the data needed to
        operate the site, understand basic usage, deliver requested subscriptions, and support
        article comments.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site may use Cloudflare Web Analytics to understand aggregate traffic and site
        performance. Newsletter signup is handled through Kit when you choose to subscribe, which
        means the email address you submit is sent to that service so it can manage the subscription
        and confirmation flow. Some article pages use Disqus for comments; when you load or use that
        feature, Disqus may process information under its own privacy terms. I do not ask these
        services to build advertising profiles for this site.
      </p>
      <p>
        Standard web infrastructure can process technical request data such as an IP address,
        browser or user-agent string, requested URL, timestamps, and security signals. Cloudflare or
        another hosting layer may use that information to deliver content, cache responses, prevent
        abuse, and keep the site available. Public resources such as articles, RSS, sitemap data,
        llms.txt, OpenAPI documents, structured data, and the public profile API are intentionally
        available to browsers, search engines, and automated agents.
      </p>
      <p>
        I do not sell personal information. If you subscribe, you can use the unsubscribe mechanism
        in a newsletter message. If you leave a third-party comment, account and deletion controls
        are managed by that provider. For a privacy question about data controlled directly through
        this site, <EmailLink title="Email Rowland">contact me by email</EmailLink> and identify the
        relevant interaction so I can understand the request.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
